5.5 Sample
In total, 52 participants took part in the study. All of them were students from the University of Applied Sciences Ruhr West. The gender distribution of the participants was 67.3% male and 32.7% female. The assignment to the respective conditions was conducted at random with 26 participants for each condition. 5.7% of all participants reported to regularly use AR-devices. Most of the participants (76.9%) stated to wear an AR-device for the ﬁrst time.

